			(property "Description" "Integrated Silicon Solution Inc. IS25LP032D\n\nThe IS25LP032D Serial Flash memory offers a versatile storage solution with high flexibility and performance in a simplified pin count package. ISSI’s “Industry Standard Serial Interface” Flash is for systems that require limited space, a low pin count, and low power consumption. The device is accessed through a 4-wire SPI Interface consisting of a Serial Data Input (SI), Serial Data Output (SO), Serial Clock (SCK), and Chip Enable (CE#) pins, which can also be configured to serve as multi-I/O (see pin descriptions).\n\n• http://www.issi.com/WW/pdf/25LP-WP032D.pdf Datasheet"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
